OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway shut after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M6 motorway has been shut in the
OL,7,FWest Midlands after a van fire and
OL,8,F"significant diesel spillage" caused
OL,9,Fsignificant delays, National Highways
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAll three lanes were closed on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound side of the carriageway
OL,14,Fbetween junction six for Gravelly Hill
OL,15,FInterchange, known as Spaghetti
OL,16,FJunction, and junction five near Castle
OL,17,FBromwich at 16:00 GMT.
OL,19,FEmergency services are on the scene
OL,20,Fwith contractors to repair the road
OL,21,Fsurface and recover the vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
