OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway shut after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been advised to follow
OL,7,Fdiversion routes via the A45127
OL,8,Fsouthbound and A47 eastbound to join
OL,9,Fthe motorway after junction five.
